msgid "Installation guide"
msgstr "安装指南"

msgid ""
"Molpro is distributed to licensees on a self-service basis using the world-"
"wide web. Those entitled to the code should obtain it from "
"https://www.molpro.net/download supplying the username and password given to"
" them. The web pages contain links to the binaries and source code, although"
" not everyone is entitled to source code, and binaries are not available for"
" every platform."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 通过万维网以自助服务的方式分发给被许可方。有权获取代码的用户应从 https://www.molpro.net/download "
"获取，并提供分配给他们的用户名和密码。网页上包含二进制文件和源代码的链接，但并非所有人都有权获取源代码，且二进制文件并非适用于所有平台。"

msgid ""
"Execution of Molpro, whether a supplied binary or built from source, "
"requires a valid licence key. Note that the key consists of two components, "
"namely a list of comma-separated key=value pairs, and a password string, and"
" these are separated by ‘&’."
msgstr ""
"运行 Molpro，无论是提供的二进制文件还是从源代码构建的，都需要一个有效的许可证密钥。请注意，密钥由两个部分组成，即一个逗号分隔的 "
"key=value 对列表和一个密码字符串，它们之间用 '&' 分隔。"

msgid "Installation of pre-built binaries"
msgstr "预构建二进制文件的安装"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid ""
"Our Linux binaries are built on the oldest supported version of Rocky Linux,"
" from Molpro 2024.2 onwards this is Rocky Linux 8 and the binaries will "
"therefore require a glibc of 2.28 or greater. If your system is older than "
"this you can either install an older version of Molpro binary, `install "
"Molpro from source <installation_guide.html#installation-from-source-"
"files>`__ if you have access, or update your system to a newer OS. For "
"running on multiple nodes using the MPI-PR binary it is recommended to "
"install UCX."
msgstr ""
"我们的 Linux 二进制文件构建于受支持的最旧版本的 Rocky Linux 上，从 Molpro 2024.2 开始，这是 Rocky Linux "
"8，因此二进制文件将需要 glibc 2.28 或更高版本。如果您的系统比这更旧，您可以安装旧版本的 Molpro 二进制文件，\\ `从源代码安装 "
"Molpro <installation_guide.html#installationfromsourcefiles>`__\\ "
"（如果您有访问权限），或者将您的系统更新到更新的操作系统。对于使用 MPI-PR 二进制文件在多个节点上运行，建议安装 UCX。"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

msgid ""
"Binaries are given as self-extracting tar archives which are installed by "
"running them on the command line. After downloading simply uncompress the "
"gzip file, ensure it is executable, then directly run the file. You will "
"need to run with ``sudo`` if you are installing somewhere outside of your "
"own user space."
msgstr ""
"二进制文件以自解压的 tar 归档文件形式提供，通过在命令行运行它们进行安装。下载后，只需解压缩 gzip "
"文件，确保其可执行，然后直接运行该文件。如果您要安装到您自己的用户空间之外的位置，则需要使用 ``sudo`` 运行。"

msgid ""
"The binaries are fully relocatable, the location can be changed when running"
" the script interactively, the default is ``/usr/local``."
msgstr "二进制文件是完全可重定位的，在交互式运行脚本时可以更改安装位置，默认位置为 ``/usr/local``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Other configuration options may also be specified in the molpro script file "
"found in the bin directory of the install."
msgstr "其他配置选项也可以在安装目录的 bin 子目录中找到的 molpro 脚本文件中指定。"

msgid "This is necessary:"
msgstr "需要完成以下步骤："

msgid "Installation of a full version"
msgstr "完整版本的安装"

msgid "Installation from source files"
msgstr "从源文件安装"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

msgid ""
"Installing Molpro from source files involves the following distinct stages:"
msgstr "从源文件安装 Molpro 涉及以下不同阶段："

msgid ""
"**Configuration** A shell script that allows specification of configuration "
"options is run, and creates a configuration file that drives subsequent "
"installation steps."
msgstr "**配置** 运行一个允许指定配置选项的 shell 脚本，并创建一个驱动后续安装步骤的配置文件。"

msgid ""
"**Building** The program is compiled and linked, and other miscellaneous "
"utilities and files, including the default options file, are built. The "
"essential resulting components are"
msgstr "**构建** 程序被编译和链接，并构建其他杂项实用程序和文件，包括默认选项文件。生成的基本组件包括"

msgid "The ``molpro`` shell script which launches the main executable."
msgstr "用于启动主可执行文件的 ``molpro`` shell 脚本。"

msgid ""
"The ``molpro.exe`` executable, which is the main program. For parallel "
"computation, multiple copies of ``molpro.exe`` are started by a single "
"instance of ``molpro`` shell script using the appropriate system utility, "
"e.g. ``mpiexec``."
msgstr ""
"``molpro.exe`` 可执行文件，即主程序。对于并行计算，单个 ``molpro`` shell 脚本实例会使用适当的系统工具（例如 "
"``mpiexec``\\ ）启动多个 ``molpro.exe`` 副本。"

msgid "Machine-ready basis-set, and other utilities and libraries."
msgstr "机器就绪的基组，以及其他实用程序和库。"

msgid ""
"**Testing** A suite of self-checking test jobs is run to provide assurance "
"that the code as built will run correctly."
msgstr "**测试** 运行一套自检测试任务，以确保构建的代码能够正确运行。"

msgid ""
"**Final Install** The program can be run directly from the source tree in "
"which it is built, but it is usually recommended to run the procedure that "
"installs the essential components in standard system directories."
msgstr "**最终安装** 程序可以直接从其构建的源代码树中运行，但通常建议运行将核心组件安装到标准系统目录的过程。"

msgid ""
"The following are required or strongly recommended for installation from "
"source code."
msgstr "以下是从源代码安装所需或强烈推荐的组件。"

msgid ""
"A modern version of GNU Fortran compiler. Molpro has Fortran code spanning "
"Fortran 77 standard up to and including F2018 standard features. We aim to "
"test Molpro regularly using the latest released version of GNU Fortran "
"compiler."
msgstr ""
"一个现代版本的 GNU Fortran 编译器。Molpro 包含从 Fortran 77 标准到 F2018 标准特性的 Fortran "
"代码。我们旨在使用最新发布的 GNU Fortran 编译器版本定期测试 Molpro。"

msgid ""
"A C++17 standard C++ compiler. We aim to test Molpro regularly with the "
"latest released version of GCC."
msgstr "一个 C++17 标准的 C++ 编译器。我们旨在使用最新发布的 GCC 版本定期测试 Molpro。"

msgid ""
"A C99 standard C compiler. This is used to compile external libraries such "
"as `libxc <https://gitlab.com/libxc/libxc>`__ and `METIS "
"<https://github.com/KarypisLab/METIS>`__."
msgstr ""
"一个 C99 标准的 C 编译器。用于编译外部库，例如 `libxc <https://gitlab.com/libxc/libxc>`__ 和 "
"`METIS <https://github.com/KarypisLab/METIS>`__\\ 。"

msgid "A Python interpreter."
msgstr "一个 Python 解释器。"

msgid "GNU Make."
msgstr "GNU Make。"

msgid ""
"CMake, version 3.14 or newer. This is used to build external libraries such "
"as `libxc <https://gitlab.com/libxc/libxc>`__."
msgstr ""
"CMake，版本 3.14 或更高。用于构建外部库，例如 `libxc <https://gitlab.com/libxc/libxc>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Eigen template library, version 3.3 or newer."
msgstr "Eigen 模板库，版本 3.3 或更高。"

msgid "Git, version 1.9 or newer."
msgstr "Git，版本 1.9 或更高。"

msgid ""
"A large scratch file system containing a directory that users may write on."
msgstr "一个包含用户可写入目录的大型临时文件系统。"

msgid ""
"`HDF5 <https://www.hdfgroup.org/solutions/hdf5/>`__ built for parallel "
"execution."
msgstr "为并行执行构建的 `HDF5 <https://www.hdfgroup.org/solutions/hdf5/>`__\\ 。"

msgid "The source code of Molpro."
msgstr "Molpro的源代码。"

msgid ""
"Molpro can also be built using compilers and libraries from `conda-forge "
"<https://conda-forge.org>`__. Here is how to construct a conda environment "
"with Molpro:"
msgstr ""
"Molpro 也可以使用来自 `conda-forge <https://conda-forge.org>`__ "
"的编译器和库进行构建。以下是如何构建包含 Molpro 的 conda 环境："

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

msgid ""
"After untarring the source code, change to the directory that has been "
"created."
msgstr "解压源代码后，切换到创建的目录。"

msgid ""
"Next check that the tools you require, such as the Fortran compiler, are in "
"your PATH. Then run the command"
msgstr "接下来检查您所需的工具（例如 Fortran 编译器）是否在您的 PATH 环境变量中。然后运行命令"

msgid ""
"A shell script ``bin/molpro`` is created, this is normally fine for a single"
" machine install, but on other setups may need modification, eg. the "
"``LAUNCHER`` variable may need changing from mpiexec to srun on a slurm "
"system. Any changes made to ``CONFIG`` or ``bin/molpro`` will be lost next "
"time ``./configure`` is invoked, so it is best to supply as many of these as"
" possible via the command line."
msgstr ""
"会创建一个 shell 脚本 ``bin/molpro``\\ ，这对于单机安装通常没问题，但在其他设置下可能需要修改，例如，在 slurm "
"系统上，\\ ``LAUNCHER`` 变量可能需要从 mpiexec 改为 srun。对 ``CONFIG`` 或 ``bin/molpro`` "
"所做的任何更改将在下次调用 ``./configure`` 时丢失，因此最好通过命令行尽可能多地提供这些设置。"

msgid "**Options specification**"
msgstr "**选项说明**"

msgid ""
"The ``configure`` script may be given command line options and is also "
"influenced by some environment variables. The complete list can be obtained "
"by running:"
msgstr "``configure`` 脚本可以接受命令行选项，并且也受某些环境变量的影响。可以通过运行以下命令获取完整列表："

msgid "while some commonly used ones include:"
msgstr "而一些常用的选项包括："

msgid ""
"``--prefix=dirname`` Specify the Molpro toplevel installation directory, the"
" default is ``/usr/local/molpro``."
msgstr "``--prefix=dirname`` 指定 Molpro 的顶层安装目录，默认为 ``/usr/local/molpro``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``--bindir=dirname`` Specify a bin directory where symbolic links will be "
"created to the Molpro executables."
msgstr "``--bindir=dirname`` 指定一个 bin 目录，其中将创建指向 Molpro 可执行文件的符号链接。"

msgid ""
"``--with-lapack-path=dirname`` The configure script will try to detect the "
"most appropriate LAPACK library, however in certain cases, in particular "
"when the LAPACK library is installed in a non-default location, configure "
"should be directed to the appropriate directory containing the LAPACK "
"library files."
msgstr ""
"``--with-lapack-path=dirname`` configure 脚本会尝试检测最合适的 LAPACK 库，但在某些情况下，特别是当 "
"LAPACK 库安装在非默认位置时，应将 configure 指向包含 LAPACK 库文件的相应目录。"

msgid ""
"``COPT=flags`` Specify compiler optimization flags for compiling C++ code."
msgstr "``COPT=flags`` 指定用于编译 C++ 代码的编译器优化标志。"

msgid ""
"``FOPT=flags`` Specify compiler optimization flags for compiling Fortran "
"code."
msgstr "``FOPT=flags`` 指定用于编译 Fortran 代码的编译器优化标志。"

msgid ""
"Additionally variables such as ``CPPFLAGS``, ``LDFLAGS``, …can be used in "
"the normal autoconf way. For instance, when Global Arrays is installed in a "
"location such that the compilers can not directly find the include and "
"library files one can specify these with, for example:"
msgstr ""
"此外，诸如 ``CPPFLAGS``\\ 、\\ ``LDFLAGS`` 等变量可以按常规的 autoconf 方式使用。例如，当 Global "
"Arrays 安装在编译器无法直接找到头文件和库文件的位置时，可以通过以下方式指定这些路径："

msgid "Another case could be specifying the location of Eigen:"
msgstr "另一种情况可能是指定 Eigen 库的位置："

msgid "Building"
msgstr "构建"

msgid ""
"After configuration, the remainder of the installation is accomplished using"
" the GNU *make* command. Remember to check the default  *make* on the system"
" is GNU *make* (cf. section `prerequisites "
"<installation_guide.html#prerequisites>`__), Molpro cannot be built with "
"other make programs. Everything needed to make a functioning program "
"together with all ancillary files is carried out by default simply by "
"issuing the command"
msgstr ""
"配置完成后，安装的剩余部分使用 GNU *make* 命令完成。请记住检查系统默认的 *make* 是否为 GNU *make*\\ （参见 `先决条件"
" <installation_guide.html#prerequisites>`__ 部分），Molpro 无法使用其他 make "
"程序构建。默认情况下，只需在 Molpro 基础目录中发出命令即可完成构建一个功能正常的程序以及所有辅助文件所需的一切操作。"

msgid "``make``"
msgstr "``make``"

msgid ""
"in the Molpro base directory. Most of the standard options for GNU *make* "
"can be used safely; in particular, ``-j`` can be used to speed up "
"compilation on a parallel machine. The program can then be accessed by "
"making sure the ``bin/`` directory is included in the PATH and issuing the "
"command ``molpro``."
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 基础目录中。大多数 GNU *make* 的标准选项可以安全使用；特别是，可以使用 ``-j`` "
"选项在并行机器上加速编译。然后，通过确保 ``bin/`` 目录包含在 PATH 环境变量中并发出命令 ``molpro``\\ ，即可访问该程序。"

msgid ""
"The default running options for Molpro are stored in the script "
"``bin/molpro``. After program installation, either using binary or from "
"source files, this file should be reviewed and adjusted, if necessary, to "
"make system wide changes."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 的默认运行选项存储在脚本 ``bin/molpro`` "
"中。程序安装后，无论是使用二进制文件还是从源文件安装，都应检查并在必要时调整此文件，以进行系统范围的更改。"

msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

msgid ""
"At this stage, it is essential to check that the program has compiled "
"correctly. The makefile target *test* (i.e., command ``make test``) will do "
"this using the full suite of test jobs, and although this takes a "
"significantly long time, it should always be done when porting for the first"
" time. A much faster test, which checks the main routes through the program,"
" can be done using ``make quicktest``. For parallel installation, it is "
"highly desirable to perform this validation with more than one running "
"process. This can be done conveniently through the ``make`` command line as,"
" for example,"
msgstr ""
"在此阶段，必须检查程序是否正确编译。Makefile 目标 *test*\\ （即命令 ``make test``\\ "
"）将使用完整的测试作业套件来完成此操作，虽然这需要相当长的时间，但在首次移植时始终应执行此操作。可以使用 ``make quicktest`` "
"进行快得多的测试，该测试检查程序的主要执行路径。对于并行安装，强烈建议使用多个运行进程来执行此验证。这可以通过 ``make`` "
"命令行方便地完成，例如，"

msgid "``make MOLPRO_OPTIONS=-n2 test``"
msgstr "``make MOLPRO_OPTIONS=-n2 test``"

msgid ""
"If any test jobs fail, the cause must be investigated. If, after due efforts"
" to fix problems of a local origin, the problem cannot be resolved, the "
"developers of Molpro would appreciate receiving a report, see our `support "
"page <https://www.molpro.net/info/support>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"如果任何测试作业失败，必须调查原因。如果在付出适当努力修复本地问题后，问题仍无法解决，Molpro 的开发人员将感谢收到报告，详情请参阅我们的\\ "
"`支持页面 <https://www.molpro.net/info/support>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Final Install"
msgstr "最终安装"

msgid ""
"Although the program can be used in situ, it is usually convenient to make a"
" system wide install for production. The install process copies only those "
"files needed at run time into appropriate installation directories as "
"specified at configuration time with ``--prefix`` (see `#configuration "
"<installation_guide.html#configuration>`__). To install the program in this "
"way, do"
msgstr ""
"虽然程序可以在原位使用，但通常为了方便生产，会进行系统范围的安装。安装过程仅将运行时所需的文件复制到配置时通过 ``--prefix`` "
"指定的适当安装目录中（参见 `#configuration <.html#configuration>`__\\ ）。要以此方式安装程序，请执行"

msgid "``make install``"
msgstr "``make install``"

msgid "The complete source tree can then be archived and deleted."
msgstr "然后可以归档并删除完整的源代码树。"
